        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "On November 3, 2025, at 06:57 UTC, reports emerged of Aldan House and east wing destruction; by 07:21 UTC, government confirmed the building was destroyed; at 07:57 UTC, PUSAR deployment was announced; injuries were documented in Nerridge by 09:52 UTC; on November 8, 2025, at 10:23 UTC, government confirmed deaths from the east wing collapse.",
